# Suppress SURICATA QUIC failed decrypt (sid:2231000) as alert noise.
# This fires on ordinary HTTP/3-over-QUIC traffic Suricata cannot
# inspect (encrypted by design) -- not a security signal, purely a
# protocol-visibility limitation. Confirmed 15/08/2026: was consuming
# index storage and inflating every live-alert event count/statistic
# (dashboard "Résumé automatique" totals, Top Offenders, etc.), not
# just visually cluttering one dashboard page's default filter
# (dashboard.py's NOISY_RULES_DEFAULT only hid it from one view without
# addressing ingestion). Suppressed at the source instead.
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2231000
